{"title": "Contents", "index": 3, "content": [{"type": "html", "value": "<body>\n<h2 class=\"sgc-toc-title sigil_not_in_toc\" style=\"text-align: center;\">知行合一王阳明1</h2>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level-1\">\n<a href=\"text00004.html\">序 章 心学诞生的前夜</a>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level-2\">\n<a href=\"text00004.html#sigil_toc_id_1\">心学横空出世</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level-2\">\n<a href=\"text00004.html#sigil_toc_id_2\">心学诞生的前夜</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level-2\"><br/>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level-1\">\n<a href=\"text00005.html#sigil_toc_id_3\">第一章 为什么悟道的是王阳明</a>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level-2\">\n<a href=\"text00005.html#sigil_toc_id_3\">何谓第一等事</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level-2\">\n<a href=\"text00005.html#sigil_toc_id_4\">两件荒唐事：新郎失踪和格竹子</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level-2\">\n<a href=\"text00005.html#sigil_toc_id_5\">彷徨和痛苦是天才的共性</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level-2\">\n<a href=\"text00005.html#sigil_toc_id_6\">有一种无趣叫仕途</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level-2\">\n<a href=\"text00005.html#sigil_toc_id_7\">转捩点</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level-2\">\n<a href=\"text00005.html#sigil_toc_id_8\">未经审视的人生不值得过</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level-2\">\n<a href=\"text00005.html#sigil_toc_id_9\">刘瑾风暴</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level-2\">\n<a href=\"text00005.html#sigil_toc_id_10\">知而不行，只是未知</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level-2\">\n<a href=\"text00005.html#sigil_toc_id_11\">释厄路</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level-2\">\n<a href=\"text00005.html#sigil_toc_id_12\">做自己的主人</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level-2\">\n<a href=\"text00005.html#sigil_toc_id_13\">新朋友和新敌人</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level-2\">\n<a href=\"text00005.html#sigil_toc_id_14\">心学的政治力</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level-2\">\n<a href=\"text00005.html#sigil_toc_id_15\">朱陆异同</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level-2\">\n<a href=\"text00005.html#sigil_toc_id_16\">贵人王琼</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level-2\"><br/>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div clas